# A transport task that never reports back does not strand the link: the
# model gives up 45 s after dialing and retries.
! connect
> dial #1 irc.test:6667 plain
? notice Connecting to irc.test:6667
@ +45s
> hangup #1
? notice Disconnected: the connection timed out; reconnecting in 5 s
? failures 1
? waiting 4.965s
